`src/agents/defaultSkills.ts` adapts the "no AI slop" skill by Peter Yang
(https://github.com/petergyang/no-ai-slop), released under the MIT License. The
word list, the pattern catalogue and the closing checklist follow that skill;
the framing is changed from editing a draft the user pastes in to constraining
the agent's own chat output, and the upstream `eval.md` checks are folded into
the "Before you send" section.

